     "start": 127,
     "end": 131
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "and im just curious if you have the links to these and any more? he looks so cute there and i'm obsessed (-:"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "| tweet link",
   "formatting": [
    {
     "type": "link",
     "start": 2,
     "end": 12,
     "url": "https://x.com/wilderwizard/status/1795656470362735046?s=46"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "hello hello anon!! not weird at all!! (and tysm for your interest in my work :D) unfortunately the website where i used to source my old scar vods is a little defunct ever since twitch implemented stricter storage rules :( but! there's alternatives!"
  },
